<title>USA: LaCrosse Footwear expects higher orders.</title>
<headline>LaCrosse Footwear expects higher orders.</headline>
<dateline>LA CROSSE, Wis. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaCrosse Footwear Inc said it expects increased advance orders for fall 1997 delivery based on indications from its major accounts.</p>
<p>The company, which last week reported higher sales and earnings in the fourth quarter ended December 31, said it is also introducing new product lines and realizing cross-selling opportunities in the industrial market.</p>
<p>LaCrosse Footwear makes and markets premium footwear and protective clothing for the sporting and outdoor markets.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 1/8 Tuesday at 11-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
